# Minimal sshd config for the fake seedbox (DESIGN.md §14). Shared by both the GNU-findutils
# and busybox images. Test-only: password auth is enabled with a throwaway, hardcoded
# password (see Dockerfile.* — "testpass123") because this container is never reachable
# outside localhost and holds no real data. Do not reuse this config for anything real.
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
